   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Welcome to The Kitchen, a comedy about the kitchen of Claude Monet, a smart Moscow restaurant. In this episode, the head chef turns up drunk before an important dinner, and a very nervous Lyova has to take charge. We start earlier, in Vika's flat, where Max wakes up in a playful mood and Vika has a busy day ahead. Here is the scene; you do not need to catch everything.",
